				"content": "## Listing - Create, Approve, Close\n\n⚠️ **MUTATING** — Leaves a closed listing\n\nTests the full listing lifecycle. Integration API always creates in pendingApproval state.\n\n**Input:** `FIXTURE_USER_ID` from config (as author)\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Manual trigger\n2. Create listing (pendingApproval state)\n3. Approve listing (published state)\n4. Close listing (closed state — cleanup)\n\n**Expected output:** Listing in closed state",
				"color": 5
			}
		},
